.TH SKILLKORPCTL 1 "2026-10-11" "skillkorp-suite 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
skillkorpctl \- configure the SkillKorp K20 Ultimate keyboard and M20 Ultimate mouse
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B skillkorpctl
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.RI [ command " [" options ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B skillkorpctl
talks to the keyboard and mouse through
.IR /dev/hidraw* .
Without a command it prints a combined status.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Overview of both devices.
.TP
.BI "keyboard " subcommand
status, info, battery, rgb, side\-rgb, polling\-rate, debounce, sleep, win\-lock,
wasd\-swap, os\-mode, gaming\-mode, remap, reset, apply, profile.
.TP
.BI "mouse " subcommand
status, battery, dpi, rate, sensor, light, power, button, restore\-buttons, monitor, apply, profile.
.TP
.B daemon
Switch profiles automatically from the focused application.
.TP
.B doctor
Check the udev rule, device access and optional tools.
.TP
.BR "tray " { start | stop | status }
Control the tray indicator.
.TP
.BR "autostart " { enable | disable | status }
Start the tray indicator with the session.
.PP
Run
.B skillkorpctl
.I command
.B \-\-help
for the options of each command.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success, 1 invalid value, 2 device missing or not accessible,
3 command refused by the device, 130 interrupted.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/skillkorp/
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR skillkorp-gui (1),
.BR skillkorp-tray (1)
